WEBVTT

00:00:27.815 --> 00:00:30.109
Even though my middle school
orchestra director

00:00:30.109 --> 00:00:31.736
was a fabulous bass teacher,

00:00:31.736 --> 00:00:34.363
she could only teach me
so much on the viola.

00:00:34.363 --> 00:00:37.033
And because there weren't
any viola teachers in my town,

00:00:37.033 --> 00:00:39.577
to be able to play the things
that I heard in my head,

00:00:39.577 --> 00:00:42.580
I turned to a teacher
who seemed to know everything:

00:00:42.622 --> 00:00:43.873
YouTube.

00:00:43.915 --> 00:00:44.916
(Laughter)

00:00:44.957 --> 00:00:47.168
By watching countless hours
of YouTube videos

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:50.046
of the great virtuosos
performing everything from Beethoven

00:00:50.088 --> 00:00:52.507
to the musical suite from "Star Wars,"

00:00:52.548 --> 00:00:54.217
I tried to mimic their techniques

00:00:54.258 --> 00:00:56.886
and incorporate them into my own playing.

00:00:57.762 --> 00:01:01.599
With a few difficult years of practice,
a lot of blood, sweat and tears